  "comment": "Agent SoW: the formation messages of 5.8 (agentsow.com 0.29.0-draft). Each message is a JSON object whose signed bytes are 'agent-sow-formation-v1', one newline, and the JCS of the message minus sig, so a message signature can never be read as a document signature, whose tag is 'agent-sow-v1'. kind is acknowledgement, receipt or void; a receipt names in of what it receives. digest is 'sha256:' and the lowercase hex SHA-256 of the signed bytes (6) of the approved replacement. An acknowledgement and a void are sent by the proposer's seat, a receipt by the counterparty's, and key is that seat's owner_key. sig is the canonical padded base64 of the 64-byte signature. The keys are the published test seeds of sow-signatures.json. THE FIXTURE IS THE AUTHORITY: change it only with a spec change alongside.",
